<Base lang="en" title="Privacy notice" description="Privacy information for ploos.no.">
<section class="wrap hero"><h1>Privacy notice</h1>
<p class="lead">Ploos AS is responsible for personal data submitted via the website contact form.</p>
<h2>Information collected</h2><p>Name, reply address, subject, message and necessary technical information when submitting. We use these details to respond to enquiries (legitimate interests or steps prior to entering into a contract).</p>
<h2>Service providers</h2><p>When activated, form submissions are processed by Cloudflare Workers and Resend for email delivery. Cloudflare Turnstile performs anti-spam checks. Storage, processing terms and any transfers outside the EEA must be reviewed and documented before the form goes live.</p>
<h2>Retention and rights</h2><p>Enquiries should be kept only as long as needed for follow-up and applicable legal obligations. You may request access, correction or erasure where provided by law.</p>
<p>For privacy enquiries, use the <a href="/en/contact/">contact form</a> once enabled. Full company and contact details must be added before production launch.</p>
</section></Base>
